sequenceDiagram
    autonumber
    actor Manager as ADMIN ou MANAGER
    participant UI as MaintenancePage
    participant API as MaintenanceController
    participant Service as MaintenanceService
    participant Prisma as PrismaService
    participant Audit as AuditLogsService
    participant Notif as NotificationsService

    Manager->>UI: Signale une panne
    UI->>API: POST /api/v1/maintenance-tickets
    API->>Service: reportFailure(dto, currentUser)
    Service->>Prisma: Transaction create ticket OPEN
    Service->>Prisma: Transaction update Resource UNDER_MAINTENANCE
    Service->>Audit: MAINTENANCE_REPORTED
    Service->>Notif: MAINTENANCE_REPORTED
    API-->>UI: Ticket cree

    Manager->>UI: Redige un constat
    UI->>API: POST /api/v1/maintenance-tickets/:id/report
    API->>Service: createReport(id, dto, currentUser)
    Service->>Prisma: Create MaintenanceReport unique per ticket
    Service->>Audit: MAINTENANCE_REPORT_CREATED
    Service->>Notif: MAINTENANCE_REPORT_CREATED
    API-->>UI: Constat cree

    Manager->>UI: Suit une intervention
    UI->>API: POST /api/v1/maintenance-tickets/:id/intervention
    API->>Service: createIntervention(id, dto)
    Service->>Prisma: Create MaintenanceIntervention
    Service->>Prisma: Update Ticket IN_PROGRESS if needed
    Service->>Audit: MAINTENANCE_INTERVENTION_CREATED
    Service->>Notif: MAINTENANCE_INTERVENTION_CREATED
    API-->>UI: Intervention creee

    Manager->>UI: Declare un retour fournisseur
    UI->>API: POST /api/v1/maintenance-tickets/:id/supplier-return
    API->>Service: createSupplierReturn(id, dto)
    Service->>Prisma: Create SupplierReturn SENT_TO_SUPPLIER
    Service->>Audit: SUPPLIER_RETURN_CREATED
    Service->>Notif: SUPPLIER_RETURN_CREATED
    API-->>UI: Retour fournisseur cree
